      "title": "家長共學社群社會資本與中學生終身學習 意識之個案研究",
      "title_en": "A Case Study on the Influence of Social Capital in Parent Learning Communities on Middle School Students' Awareness of Lifelong Learning.",
      "abstract": "中學生面對多元變動的世代，教育更強調自主學習能力以達成終身學習素養。近年來， 家長參與亦逐漸成為連結學校與家庭的重要系統，並參與學生學習。現行教育多偏重升學學 群之生涯探索，較少從家長參與及其社會資本歷程探討其如何透過支持網絡與資源連結，影 響中學生終身學習意識之形成與發展，為本研究關注焦點。\n\n本研究採個案研究法，以半結構式訪談蒐集資料。研究對象為參與家長共學社群之中學 生家長與學生，共計 12 組家庭，並以持續比較分析進行資料整理與分析，歸納家長共學社群 社會資本運作樣貌，以及其對中學生終身學習意識發展歷程之影響。\n\n研究結果發現：一、家長參與共學社群初期以子女學習為主，而後成為跨家庭之學習支 持與資源共享網絡。二、家長共學社群之連結有助於促進中學生之資訊資本、關係資本與支 持系統，提升其學習動機、學習效能感等終身學習意識。三、社會資本之累積受到家長參與 程度、互動頻率與社群信任關係等影響，形塑中學生持續學習之態度與價值觀。四、社群連 結幫助學生學習主動探索與自主學習，培養自我成長及終身學習之意識。最後歸納家長共學\n\n社群社會資本運作對中學生終身學習意識發展之歷程，並提出學校推動親職與終身學習教育 之實務建議。",
      "abstract_en": "In an increasingly diverse and rapidly changing society, education emphasizes self-directed learning and lifelong learning competencies among middle school students. Parental involvement has also become\n\nan important bridge between schools and families. This study explores how social capital within parent learning communities influences students’ lifelong learning awareness through support networks and\n\nresource connections.\n\nA case study approach was adopted, with semi-structured interviews conducted with 12 families participating in parent learning communities. Data were analyzed using constant comparative analysis.\n\nThe findings indicate that parent learning communities gradually develop from supporting children’s learning into cross-family networks for resource sharing and learning support. These\n\nnetworks enhance students’ informational and relational capital, strengthen learning motivation and self-efficacy, and foster positive attitudes toward continuous learning. Community trust, parental\n\nparticipation, and interaction also contribute to students’ self-directed learning, self-development, and lifelong learning awareness. The study concludes with practical recommendations for schools to promote\n\nparenting education and lifelong learning.",
      "keywords": "家長共學社群、社會資本、中學生、終身學習",
      "keywords_en": "Parent Co-learning Community; Social Capital; Middle School Students ; Lifelong Learning.",
      "display_presenters": "戴慧真",
      "author_info_lines": [
        "戴慧真 博士生｜國立中正大學成人及繼續教育學系",
        "國立中正大學成人及繼續教育學系 博士班"
      ],
      "author_info_lines_en": []
