      "title": "地方創生婦女之幸福感、自我效能與創業意圖研究",
      "title_en": "A Study on Women's Well-Being, Self-Efficacy and Entrepreneurial Intention in Regional Revitalization",
      "abstract": "本研究旨在探討地方創生政策下，參與培力基地課程婦女之「幸福感」、「自我效能」與「創業意圖」現況關係及其預測情形。本研究採普查法，以中部某縣市婦女培力基地之學員為研究母體，共獲得有效問卷69份。\n\n鑑於資料分配顯著偏離常態，本研究採用無母數 Spearman 等級相關分析，並結合自動線性模型與多元線性迴歸進行分析。研究結果顯示學員之幸福感與自我效能普遍維持中高水準，但創業意圖具備高度群體內異質性。相關分析結果證實，幸福感與自我效能皆與創業意圖呈顯著正相關；然而投入使用多元迴歸模型分析後，受兩個自變項（幸福感及自我效能）高度內在共變的稀釋效應影響，個別變項之獨立淨預測力皆未達顯著水準，但模型整體展現出顯著預測力。此一統計結果反映出內在心理資產間的高重疊性，亦暗示單靠心理資本對創業意圖之解釋力有限。據此，本研究建議未來政策與創生基地在穩定心理賦權的同時，可進一步結合外部微型創業試銷通路與減輕婦女家庭照顧之支持機制，以多元管道催化其創業動能。",
      "abstract_en": "This study examines the relationships among women’s well-being, self-efficacy, and entrepreneurial intention, as well as their predictive patterns, within regional revitalization. A census approach yielded 69 valid questionnaires from a women's empowerment base in central Taiwan.\n\nThe results indicate that participants generally maintained medium-to-high well-being and self-efficacy, whereas entrepreneurial intention exhibited high intra-group heterogeneity. Non-parametric correlation analysis confirmed that both well-being and self-efficacy significantly correlated with entrepreneurial intention. However, in multivariate regression models, the independent net predictive effects of each variable were non-significant due to high internal covariation, despite the overall model remaining significant. This reflects the high overlap among psychological assets and implies the limited predictive power of psychological capital alone on entrepreneurial intention. Consequently, future policies should sustain psychological empowerment while integrating external trial-marketing channels and care support to catalyze women’s entrepreneurial momentum.\n\nKey Words: Regional Revitalization, Women, Well-Being, Self-efficacy, Entrepreneurial Intention",
      "keywords": "地方創生、婦女、幸福感、自我效能、創業意圖",
      "keywords_en": "",
      "display_presenters": "高停雅",
      "author_info_lines": [
        "高停雅 學生｜國立雲林科技大學數位媒體設計系地方創生智能設計碩士在職專班",
        "楊晰勛 教授｜國立雲林科技大學數位媒體設計系"
      ],
      "author_info_lines_en": [
        "Ting-Ya Gao Student｜Department of Digital Media Design In-service Master’s Program of Smart Design for Regional Revitalization, National Yunlin University of Science and Technology",
        "Hsi-Hsun Yang Professor｜Department of Digital Media Design, National Yunlin University of Science and Technology"
      ]
